  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1020.06 Precast Units",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1020.06 Precast Units. Precast units shall:\n\n(a) Have at least one inlet and one inspection cover; and\n\n(b) Be round or polygonal in cross-sectional shape.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
